From 0932d6e175989983bf9dc47e0ac2d24d270d07fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:16:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] hub admission phase 2: deterministic score, queue
 --explain and capacity effect report

kanban_admission_score.rank scores hub-local ready/review rows over the full replica: capped effective priority
+ class + bounded open descendants + bounded current-interval aging - failures, weights in kanban.admission.weights
(validated, finite). Opted-in hubs order each lane by score, then keep the marked-first pool partition; workers keep
plain priority. queue_note carries the score summary; 'hermes kanban queue [--explain ID] [--json]' prints order,
breakdown, position and pools; 'queue --report' measures ready-wait p50 around each capacity card's completion and
flags repeat no-effect origins (recommendation only).
